Hyprland helper scripts and companion configuration vendored from:

Repository: https://github.com/darthtrevino/temu-omarchy
Commit: 6279ec6cfab97de0de230f5c284fe3294abf8ca8

Vendored paths:
- bin/hypr-* (audio helpers deliberately excluded)
- config/hypr/{hypridle,hyprlock,hyprpaper}.conf
- config/mako/config      -> config/mako-config
- config/rofi/config.rasi -> config/rofi-config.rasi
- config/fontconfig/fonts.conf

hyprland.lua is not vendored verbatim; templates/hyprland.lua.j2 is an adapted
copy and records its own differences from upstream in a header comment.
